      {
        "parameters": {
          "jsCode": "// Inbox fetch (Gmail: watch unread in INBOX). Sandboxed sample batch so the\n// workflow runs end-to-end without OAuth. Swap this node for a Gmail Trigger in prod.\nconst emails = [\n  {\n    messageId: 'msg_18f2a1',\n    from: 'rachel.kim@brightloop.io',\n    subject: 'How do I export my invoices to CSV?',\n    body: \"Hi team, I'm trying to pull all invoices from Q2 into a CSV for our accountant but I can't find an export button anywhere in the billing tab. Is this possible on the Starter plan? Thanks! Rachel\",\n    receivedAt: '2026-07-25T08:14:02Z'\n  },\n  {\n    messageId: 'msg_18f2a2',\n    from: 'dan.oconnor@ferrostructural.com',\n    subject: 'URGENT: charged twice this month',\n    body: 'This is the second time this has happened. My card was charged $199 on July 3rd AND July 5th for the same subscription. I want a refund immediately or I am cancelling and disputing with my bank. Extremely frustrated.',\n    receivedAt: '2026-07-25T08:22:47Z'\n  },\n  {\n    messageId: 'msg_18f2a3',\n    from: 'priya.nair@atlasgrid.dev',\n    subject: 'Please upgrade our workspace to Business tier',\n    body: \"Hello, we'd like to move our workspace (atlasgrid-prod) from Team to Business tier starting next billing cycle, and add 12 more seats. Can you send over the updated quote and provision the upgrade? Thanks, Priya (IT Admin)\",\n    receivedAt: '2026-07-25T08:31:10Z'\n  },\n  {\n    messageId: 'msg_18f2a4',\n    from: 'noreply@statuspage.brightloop.io',\n    subject: 'FYI: Scheduled maintenance window Sunday 02:00 UTC',\n    body: 'This is an automated notification. Our upstream data provider has scheduled maintenance on Sunday between 02:00 and 04:00 UTC. No action is required. Brief API slowdowns may occur.',\n    receivedAt: '2026-07-25T08:40:33Z'\n  },\n  {\n    messageId: 'msg_18f2a5',\n    from: 'winner-dept@lucky-prizes-now.biz',\n    subject: 'Congratulations!!! You have WON a $500 gift card',\n    body: 'Dear lucky user, you have been SELECTED to receive a $500 Amazon gift card. Click here within 24 hours to claim your prize: http://lucky-prizes-now.biz/claim?id=88123. Act fast!',\n    receivedAt: '2026-07-25T08:44:59Z'\n  }\n];\nreturn emails.map(e => ({ json: e })).slice(0, 5);"
        },
        "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "name": "Sample Inbox (Demo Data)",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
